(FLW-04: each `then,` / `but if ... then,` / `otherwise,` branch consumes
 actions until the sentence ends.
 Also covers FLW-05 (commas separate several actions in one branch) and
 FLW-06 (the period ends the whole if sentence, so `print "outside"` is
 unconditional).
